WEBVTT

00:00.192 --> 00:01.218
So if you didn't see my last

00:01.718 --> 00:02.469
video, I just got my wedding

00:02.517 --> 00:03.832
ring today and I was a little

00:03.864 --> 00:05.580
bit disappointed. Let me give

00:06.080 --> 00:06.655
you a little bit of a backstory

00:06.751 --> 00:07.922
before I do the whole reveal.

00:08.387 --> 00:09.975
So the first design that I

00:10.475 --> 00:11.418
created for this ring looked

00:11.918 --> 00:14.433
like this. I wanted to do a band

00:14.465 --> 00:16.790
with pavé crystals all around it

00:17.290 --> 00:19.244
that go from green, brown, and

00:19.276 --> 00:20.527
then like champagne and any

00:20.559 --> 00:22.708
colors in between because my

00:22.788 --> 00:24.793
eyes are green and my fiancé's

00:24.873 --> 00:26.028
eyes are brown. So I So I

00:26.528 --> 00:26.782
thought it was just a really

00:26.814 --> 00:29.059
cute way to like represent us

00:29.559 --> 00:30.599
and show us coming together.

00:30.968 --> 00:32.733
Here's a picture of a ring that

00:33.233 --> 00:34.145
I use as inspiration for the

00:34.257 --> 00:36.583
actual color scheme of my

00:37.083 --> 00:39.150
wedding ring. So now for the

00:39.166 --> 00:41.492
ring reveal. I'm not upset that

00:41.556 --> 00:43.016
it's like an ugly ring or

00:43.516 --> 00:44.668
something. It's still gorgeous.

00:44.780 --> 00:46.898
It's just not the colors that I

00:46.930 --> 00:49.480
expected or hoped. So this is

00:49.673 --> 00:52.095
the ring. I just don't really

00:52.175 --> 00:54.703
see much green in it, which is

00:54.816 --> 00:57.283
why I was a bit upset. It is

00:57.396 --> 00:58.637
beautiful, it's just not what I

00:58.686 --> 01:00.346
expected. So what do you guys

01:00.459 --> 01:02.410
think? Am I crazy, or should I

01:02.910 --> 01:03.249
say something?
